    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I've always found math intriguing, especially its patterns and logic. As a lower secondary education graduate, I appreciate how it connects to real-world problems like baking ratios or painting dimensions. It’s not about rote memorization but understanding concepts that make sense.",
